---
name: Theo Vaughn
group: personality
order: 2
description: A visual artist with a striking body of work and no space online that did it justice.
scope:
  - Personal Brand
  - Portfolio Experience
  - Art Direction
heroImage: ../../assets/tshepo.png
heroImageAlt: The gallery-inspired personal brand created for visual artist Theo Vaughn.
story:
  challenge: >
    Theo's work was bold and deeply personal, but it lived in cramped, borrowed corners
    of the internet that flattened it. Collectors and curators couldn't experience the
    scale or intent, and the pieces lost their power the moment they went digital.
  approach: >
    We treated the presence like a gallery, not a grid. Space to stand back, pacing that
    lets each piece hold your attention, and an experience that honours the intent behind
    the work. The aim was to make viewing online feel as deliberate as viewing in person.
  outcome: >
    The work finally commands the room it deserves. Curators reach out already
    understanding the vision, and Theo's presence feels like an extension of the art
    rather than a compromise of it. Considered, confident, and unmistakably his.
pullQuote: A portfolio should feel like a room built for the work. So that's what we built.
---

Art loses something in a cramped feed. We gave Theo's work the walls, the light, and
the quiet it needed to land the way it was meant to.
